// ────────────── Output Configuration ──────────────
// Run `niri msg outputs` to inspect connected displays.
// The primary internal display is configured in config.kdl as eDP-1.
//
// Internal Panel: Chimei Innolux Corporation 0x1521
// Preferred Mode: 1920x1080@144.003
// Power-saving alternative mode: 1920x1080@60.004
//
// External monitor template (uncomment and adjust as needed when connecting HDMI / USB-C DP):
/- output "HDMI-A-1" {
    mode "1920x1080@60.000"
    scale 1.0
    position x=1920 y=0
}